- [Gabrielle] And you
believe in content.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.917
- Always but brand.

00:11:40.917 --> 00:11:43.792
The Boston Globe and The
Washington Post are brands and

00:11:43.792 --> 00:11:47.166
for the 35, 40 million
if you make that brand.

00:11:47.166 --> 00:11:48.840
When he bought the Washington
Post a lot of people asked me

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.792
