Periscope and things of that

00:13:02.458 --> 00:13:06.333
nature but they're behind the
written word, you can look,

00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:07.745
I know when Donald's tweeting

00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:09.811
as Donald and when 
it's his team doing it.

00:13:09.811 --> 00:13:10.479
- Yeah.

00:13:10.479 --> 00:13:11.625
- Hillary is a machine.

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:16.792
It's all not her and so I think
