that as well as Donald's doing

00:13:20.417 --> 00:13:24.083
if he or if she would
do a lot more video.

00:13:24.083 --> 00:13:26.333
For example,
I just gave this talk.

00:13:26.333 --> 00:13:27.959
I was looking at
people saying nice things.

00:13:27.959 --> 00:13:30.333
I replied in video form.

00:13:30.333 --> 00:13:33.125
That person knows it's me.

00:13:33.125 --> 00:13:36.425
They don't have to guess if it's
my intern, if it's somebody back

00:13:36.425 --> 00:13:40.860
in the States and that depth is
a connection and so I think the

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:45.375
great miss of politicians is not
to use more video and audio and

00:13:45.375 --> 00:13:46.208
that's why I would say that

00:13:46.208 --> 00:13:47.583
they're not using it
as well as they could.

00:13:47.583 --> 00:13:50.079
- Because they're scared.
They want control.

00:13:50.079 --> 00:13:52.450
- Of course and they want scale.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.645
- Yeah.
- So if--

00:13:53.645 --> 00:13:55.291
- You can get scale, can't you?

00:13:55.291 --> 00:13:58.125
- You can get scale if your
interns are tweeting for you.

00:13:58.125 --> 00:14:00.000
It's harder for you to do it.
- Alright.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.750
- But I think when Hillary's on
the way to her next event, in

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:07.917
the 10 minutes she's in the car
she should be videoing 10 people

00:14:07.917 --> 00:14:09.523
because it scales.

00:14:09.523 --> 00:14:13.333
Taylor Swift does this
extremely well as a pop star.

00:14:13.333 --> 00:14:14.792
She does a lot of engagement.

00:14:14.792 --> 00:14:16.583
She shows up at
people's weddings.

00:14:16.583 --> 00:14:19.917
It's not a good use of Taylor
Swift's time to show up to

00:14:19.917 --> 00:14:21.250
