that they said,

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.583
"Taylor, can stop
by my wedding," but it is.

00:14:23.583 --> 00:14:25.000
Let me tell you why.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.205
When she goes even though
there's only 45 people at that

00:14:27.205 --> 00:14:29.417
wedding or a hundred people at
that wedding or 200 people at

00:14:29.417 --> 00:14:32.875
that wedding,
the media picks up on it and

00:14:32.875 --> 00:14:35.917
gives her millions at scale.

00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:37.750
And so what people are
misunderstanding is that when

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:41.750
you do authentic deep
engagement, the market rewards

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:45.217
you for it and you
actually get scale.

00:14:45.217 --> 00:14:46.250
- But that's hard to fake.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.875
You gotta be authentic you got
to be genuine when you do it.

00:14:48.875 --> 00:14:50.792
So,--
- It's no different.

00:14:50.792 --> 00:14:54.125
It's no different than the guy
asked in the other room he goes,

00:14:54.125 --> 00:14:56.834
"Well how do you
become a thought leader?"

00:14:56.834 --> 00:14:57.917
By being a thought leader.

00:14:57.917 --> 00:15:00.750
You're right, it's hard.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.959
It's hard to be authentic.
So how do you be authentic?

00:15:03.959 --> 00:15:06.550
By being authentic.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.495
You know, listen I always used
to say this, it's like doing

00:15:11.495 --> 00:15:16.000
push-ups. You and I if we want
muscles you have to do push-ups.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.834
You can't read about
the doing push-ups.

00:15:17.834 --> 00:15:22.208
You can't outsource doing the
push-ups and so there's a reason

00:15:22.208 --> 00:15:26.458
that people who are authentic
and actually doing are winning.

00:15:26.458 --> 00:15:30.324
Because everybody else is trying
to figure out the shortcut.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.417
- Ah, but it's interesting.

00:15:33.417 --> 00:15:35.708
You talk about all this new
technology and you're also

00:15:35.708 --> 00:15:38.125
talking about some
very traditional values.

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:39.458
- Because I believe technology

00:15:39.458 --> 00:15:42.500
is the gateway drug
to traditional.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.500
- Hmmmm.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.875
- I believe what I do here
allows me to get to the moment

00:15:46.875 --> 00:15:49.763
where if you watched me, all
the stuff he recorded, all those

00:15:49.763 --> 00:15:53.834
handshakes, all those selfies,
it was all the work I did here

00:15:53.834 --> 00:15:55.166
that got to the moment where

00:15:55.166 --> 00:15:58.291
I got to shake his hand
and take that picture.

00:15:58.291 --> 00:16:03.250
So I use technology
to scale the intimacy.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.458
- And that pays off in
terms of more business.

00:16:05.458 --> 00:16:06.583
- I think so.

00:16:06.583 --> 00:16:08.417
Sure, I mean look, think about

00:16:08.417 --> 00:16:10.291
who you're willing
to do things for.

00:16:10.291 --> 00:16:13.458
It starts with your family
then it's your best friends,

00:16:13.458 --> 00:16:16.291
then it's your friends,
then it's your acquaintances,

00:16:16.291 --> 00:16:18.542
then it's strangers.
- Sure.

00:16:18.542 --> 00:16:21.417
- I'm trying to close it.

00:16:21.417 --> 00:16:23.232
- So you're making
the world smaller.

00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:26.125
- 100% by putting in the work.

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:28.750
- [Gabrielle] And then you have
more customers comes to you.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.500
- Absolutely and to me, if
you're really smart, the way

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.272
I think of it and this is very
important I make the world

00:16:35.272 --> 00:16:39.425
smaller for 
potential customers,

00:16:39.425 --> 00:16:41.125
not customers.

00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:43.583
That's a very
important distinction.

00:16:43.583 --> 00:16:45.708
If you were to do things with

00:16:45.708 --> 00:16:49.792
the intent to cash in on it,
you will lose.

00:16:49.792 --> 00:16:52.250
Because the other
person will taste it.

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:56.000
The reason my stuff works is the
same reason when you asked me

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.166
why don't you tell me what to
tell the conservative business

00:16:58.166 --> 00:17:00.000
people why they should hire you.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.834
I don't want to.
I don't like to sell.

00:17:02.834 --> 00:17:07.165
I like to guilt and leverage
people into being interested.

00:17:07.165 --> 00:17:08.500
- [Gabrielle] But that's
interesting, you describe

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:09.791
