- I am.

00:17:09.791 --> 00:17:11.080
- [Gabrielle] As
a wine salesman.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.619
- I am.

00:17:12.619 --> 00:17:14.583
I think the best salespeople
in the world are the ones that

00:17:14.583 --> 00:17:17.625
don't sell that are the ones
that actually have people coming

00:17:17.625 --> 00:17:19.653
to them to buy.

00:17:19.653 --> 00:17:23.125
And there's only one way to do
that, provide upfront value with

00:17:23.125 --> 00:17:28.333
zero expectation in
return on a micro level.

00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:31.834
On a macro level, I expect
it turning out to being good.

00:17:31.834 --> 00:17:34.458
- But on the individual--
- Correct.

00:17:34.458 --> 00:17:38.708
Correct, so if I give you 50
interviews, a business advice,

00:17:38.708 --> 00:17:43.375
a tip on a stock, pick up your
daughter at a abandoned house in

00:17:43.375 --> 00:17:46.500
New Jersey and I ask you
for something small--

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.000
- That was weird.
- That was very weird.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.125
I have no idea but
I'm trying to go extreme.

00:17:50.125 --> 00:17:50.792
- Yeah.

00:17:50.792 --> 00:17:53.875
- If I do so much for you and
I ask for a little bit in return

00:17:53.875 --> 00:17:56.500
and you say no, I'm unphased.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.041
I think most people are phased.

00:17:58.041 --> 00:18:02.333
Most people give and do
expect something in return.

00:18:02.333 --> 00:18:05.500
I think the reason I'm
winning is 'cause I don't.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:07.125
I just don't.

00:18:07.125 --> 00:18:09.166
I know it works out but

00:18:09.166 --> 00:18:13.000
I'm empathetic to know
sometimes it doesn't.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.125
Sometimes people want from
you and don't want to give and

00:18:15.125 --> 00:18:17.583
that's okay because you
will win on a macro level.

00:18:17.583 --> 00:18:19.917
I genuinely believe that.

00:18:19.917 --> 00:18:21.959
- I should know this but how do
you make the bulk of your money?

00:18:21.959 --> 00:18:23.500
What's the most profitable?

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.083
