I invest in sell or go public.

00:18:47.635 --> 00:18:48.792
I have big events.

00:18:48.792 --> 00:18:50.583
Right, when Twitter went public.

00:18:50.583 --> 00:18:52.250
When Facebook went public.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:56.125
When Buddy Media was bought
