00:19:27.917 --> 00:19:31.166
To build a business that was
client services would've not

00:19:31.166 --> 00:19:32.375
been interesting to me.

00:19:32.375 --> 00:19:34.291
They're just not
good businesses.

00:19:34.291 --> 00:19:36.610
