anything you want to sell,

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.660
anything you want to do you

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.792
should have a media/content part.

00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:40.458
- I think so.

00:19:40.458 --> 00:19:42.542
I think so.
That's why I built it.

00:19:42.542 --> 00:19:44.125
- [Woman] Last question.
- No problem.

00:19:44.125 --> 00:19:46.375
Yes, and that's why I built it
because remember right now

00:19:46.375 --> 00:19:48.500
I'm still hungry and on fire
and I want to buy the

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.500
New York Jets but I've hopefully
another 60 years in my life and

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.125
here's what's gonna
happen in those 60 years.

00:19:55.125 --> 00:19:57.458
My kids are gonna grow
up and have interests.

00:19:57.458 --> 00:20:00.667
I'm gonna lose family
and friends to diseases.

00:20:00.667 --> 00:20:03.667
Something will happen at a macro
geopolitical level that scares

00:20:03.667 --> 00:20:07.959
me and so not only do I want a
marketing machine to sell the

00:20:07.959 --> 00:20:12.125
