flip it or to buy at an American

00:20:12.125 --> 00:20:15.667
football team but if my mother
dies from a rare disease that's

00:20:15.667 --> 00:20:18.792
not been cured, I'm gonna want
to use that machine to build

00:20:18.792 --> 00:20:21.250
awareness and to find a cure.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:25.291
If my daughter becomes
infatuated with volcanoes I want

00:20:25.291 --> 00:20:28.750
