to have for the rest of my life.

00:20:41.208 --> 00:20:43.078
- Interesting so it doesn't
really matter if you never get

00:20:43.078 --> 00:20:44.625
to buy the Jets anyway.

00:20:44.625 --> 00:20:47.750
- Just the process to buy them.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.041
To me the journey is way more

00:20:49.041 --> 00:20:50.667
interesting than
the finish line.

00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:51.500
- Interesting.

